  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37781098",
      "title": "Creating our First Images",
      "sourceHash": "e1efdfe4e4132d68e3f213109045506ef8a790e8b6f7aa97e98cc568f8088aa5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.01,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "To get started very easily on this server here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 8.19,
          "en": "you can simply access one of the newbies chats",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.19,
          "end": 10.44,
          "en": "in the newcomer rooms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.44,
          "end": 13.02,
          "en": "As mentioned, you have the server right here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.02,
          "end": 14.64,
          "en": "Then you have different categories.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 17.4,
          "en": "In this case, we need the newcomer rooms categories",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.4,
          "end": 19.05,
          "en": "or one of these.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.05,
          "end": 22.8,
          "en": "And there you can just select one of the newbie server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.8,
          "end": 25.41,
          "en": "Here, for example, newbie 23.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.41,
          "end": 29.88,
          "en": "And inside these chats you see the prompts of other users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.88,
          "end": 34.383,
          "en": "and the images Midjourney generated based on these prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.22,
          "end": 37.23,
          "en": "Again, we are using prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.23,
          "end": 40.86,
          "en": "We know this concept from ChatGPT already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.86,
          "end": 43.2,
          "en": "but if you look at these prompts here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.2,
          "end": 46.71,
          "en": "these are all the prompts added by other users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.71,
          "end": 49.53,
          "en": "of the Midjourney Discord server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.53,
          "end": 51.12,
          "en": "You see that the prompts are different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 53.013,
          "en": "than the ones we saw in ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.94,
          "end": 55.86,
          "en": "The prompts are more about keywords",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.86,
          "end": 59.64,
          "en": "and about being as concise as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.64,
          "end": 62.49,
          "en": "We'll dive into how to create such prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.49,
          "end": 65.94,
          "en": "in a bit more detail later throughout this module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.94,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "But the core idea is that you can add a prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "inside one of these chats and then it takes a while",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 76.08,
          "en": "until Midjourney generates the images for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.08,
          "end": 78.09,
          "en": "based on these prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.09,
          "end": 80.07,
          "en": "And while they're inside the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 83.97,
          "en": "more and more images are generated based on prompts added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.97,
          "end": 88.97,
          "en": "by other users, and you can also add your prompts in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.94,
          "end": 90.93,
          "en": "but to be honest,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.93,
          "end": 93.15,
          "en": "I don't think it's a very organized way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.15,
          "end": 95.7,
          "en": "to find your own images again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.7,
          "end": 98.00999999999999,
          "en": "therefore, I recommend another way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.00999999999999,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "to create your images in Midjourney.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 103.83,
          "en": "In addition to having these public chats",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.83,
          "end": 107.00999999999999,
          "en": "where also everybody sees your prompts and images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.00999999999999,
          "end": 111.81,
          "en": "you can also exchange direct messages in Discord",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.81,
          "end": 114.47999999999999,
          "en": "like in many other chat tools.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.47999999999999,
          "end": 117.42,
          "en": "And if you start a direct conversation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117.42,
          "end": 119.55,
          "en": "with the Midjourney Bot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.55,
          "end": 122.58,
          "en": "so this is basically the user so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.58,
          "end": 124.65,
          "en": "that generates the images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.65,
          "end": 127.56,
          "en": "Then you have all your images and all your prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.56,
          "end": 131.85,
          "en": "organized in your own private message channel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.85,
          "end": 134.31,
          "en": "To be able to exchange messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.31,
          "end": 138.39,
          "en": "with the Discord chatbot here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.39,
          "end": 140.7,
          "en": "you have to enable direct messaging",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 143.25,
          "en": "inside this server first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.25,
          "end": 145.62,
          "en": "For this, you access these server settings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.62,
          "end": 150.62,
          "en": "appear in this area, go down to privacy settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.1,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "and there enable the direct messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 157.983,
          "en": "So this here should be activated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.91,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "By selecting done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 163.71,
          "en": "you can now simply right click onto the Midjourney Bot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.71,
          "end": 167.13,
          "en": "so you can find the Midjourney Bot over and over",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.13,
          "end": 168.87,
          "en": "here in this newbies channel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 173.87,
          "en": "So you right click it and now you select message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.81,
          "end": 178.11,
          "en": "And this now brings us to our direct messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.11,
          "end": 182.04,
          "en": "here to our chat with the Midjourney Bot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.04,
          "end": 183.81,
          "en": "And inside this chat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.81,
          "end": 188.103,
          "en": "we will now create all our images with Midjourney.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189,
          "end": 191.4,
          "en": "Midjourney is a different AI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.4,
          "end": 194.34,
          "en": "than the one we saw with ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.34,
          "end": 197.94,
          "en": "Therefore, initiating this image creation process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.94,
          "end": 201.3,
          "en": "works a bit different with different prompts, so to say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.3,
          "end": 203.643,
          "en": "than we saw it with ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 207.36,
          "en": "We will dive into prompt engineering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.36,
          "end": 210.6,
          "en": "in a lot of detail in the next module of this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.6,
          "end": 214.05,
          "en": "Here I just want to focus onto the basics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.05,
          "end": 215.79,
          "en": "when using Midjourney",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.79,
          "end": 219.57,
          "en": "therefore, writing specific and detailed prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.57,
          "end": 221.373,
          "en": "is not the core focus now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.6,
          "end": 225.54,
          "en": "However, we have to write a prompt or a command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.54,
          "end": 228.81,
          "en": "to initiate the image creation process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.81,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "As you see, I have some images in here already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 234,
          "en": "And to create the images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234,
          "end": 238.143,
          "en": "we always go down to our message area here once again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.49,
          "end": 243.84,
          "en": "Now, if you want to create an image of a tropical island,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.84,
          "end": 247.35,
          "en": "for example, this doesn't work as we are used to do it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.35,
          "end": 248.58,
          "en": "in ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.58,
          "end": 253.58,
          "en": "So for example, create an image of a tropical island.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.26,
          "end": 257.58,
          "en": "This won't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.58,
          "end": 260.49,
          "en": "This just adds our message to the chat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 263.913,
          "en": "as we know it from a typical chat like conversation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.84,
          "end": 269.22,
          "en": "Instead, as we saw it already with the subscribe command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.22,
          "end": 272.15999999999997,
          "en": "we have to add a slash ahead of any command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 272.15999999999997,
          "end": 274.08,
          "en": "ahead of any interaction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 274.08,
          "end": 276.633,
          "en": "we want to start with the Midjourney Bot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 277.5,
          "end": 280.08,
          "en": "You can see a lot of different commands",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.08,
          "end": 281.43,
          "en": "that are available in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 281.43,
          "end": 285.12,
          "en": "and many of these will be covered in the next module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.12,
          "end": 287.7,
          "en": "The subscribe command is something you know already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.7,
          "end": 291.6,
          "en": "but the most important command is the slash imagine command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 291.6,
          "end": 294.663,
          "en": "which allows us to add our prompt afterwards.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.28,
          "end": 297.54,
          "en": "So if we add this command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 297.54,
          "end": 300.96,
          "en": "now in here we can now add the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 300.96,
          "end": 303.663,
          "en": "about the image that should be generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 304.89,
          "end": 309.06,
          "en": "And prompts in Midjourney are all about keywords.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.06,
          "end": 311.91,
          "en": "So we don't add full phrases in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 311.91,
          "end": 315.81,
          "en": "We just type something like tropical island.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 315.81,
          "end": 318.66,
          "en": "Then we add a comma just for better readability",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 318.66,
          "end": 320.16,
          "en": "for us human beings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 320.16,
          "end": 324.39,
          "en": "So we could add something like beach and sunshine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 324.39,
          "end": 328.27,
          "en": "With enter, we now start the image creation process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 330.15,
          "end": 332.64,
          "en": "and instead of adding our message to the chat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 332.64,
          "end": 335.01,
          "en": "we get this bot answer here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 335.01,
          "end": 338.15999999999997,
          "en": "with the information that our image creation process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 338.15999999999997,
          "end": 340.93,
          "en": "is in the queue so to say, now it started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 341.97,
          "end": 344.85,
          "en": "and now we get the percentage indicator here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 344.85,
          "end": 347.253,
          "en": "when the image will be finished.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 348.39,
          "end": 349.32,
          "en": "Now it is done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 349.32,
          "end": 353.22,
          "en": "and I think we have some decent results already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 353.22,
          "end": 356.4,
          "en": "Midjourney always provides the images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 356.4,
          "end": 361.053,
          "en": "created in a so-called grid with four different images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 362.43,
          "end": 366.94,
          "en": "You can then select these images to make these a bit bigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 367.83,
          "end": 370.8,
          "en": "and then you can also open the images in the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 370.8,
          "end": 373.293,
          "en": "to show these in the full resolution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 374.22,
          "end": 376.8,
          "en": "If we zoom into here like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 376.8,
          "end": 381.18,
          "en": "we get the full quality of our images, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 381.18,
          "end": 383.67,
          "en": "Each image is created in a resolution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 383.67,
          "end": 388.32,
          "en": "of 1,024 times 1,024 pixels by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 388.32,
          "end": 391.56,
          "en": "in the most recent Midjourney versions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 391.56,
          "end": 393.09000000000003,
          "en": "And what you can also see already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 393.09000000000003,
          "end": 397.32,
          "en": "is that although we use the same prompt obviously",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 397.32,
          "end": 401.79,
          "en": "all images show an island with the beach and some sunshine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 401.79,
          "end": 404.31,
          "en": "but the images are quite different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 404.31,
          "end": 407.22,
          "en": "especially if you compare this image here, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 407.22,
          "end": 410.85,
          "en": "with the ones above, we have a different setting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 410.85,
          "end": 412.53,
          "en": "This is a bit darker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 412.53,
          "end": 417.42,
          "en": "this is a bit brighter, a different image style, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 417.42,
          "end": 420.96,
          "en": "So these are just the outcomes we get based on this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 420.96,
          "end": 423.843,
          "en": "quite short and not very detailed prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 426,
          "end": 429.27,
          "en": "We won't dive into image styling here in this module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 429.27,
          "end": 431.16,
          "en": "I mentioned this already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
